        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LAST APARTMENT REMAINING - FIXED PRICE €330,000\r\n\r\nFIXED PRICING - SOLD ON A FIRST COME, FIRST SERVED BASIS.\r\n\r\nA New Standard of City Living in Dublin 8 - Enquire Now – Viewings Available\r\n\r\nDNG are delighted to present Emmet Lodge, offering 32 newly refurbished two-bedroom apartments. \r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to purchase a beautiful newly refurbished apartment in this highly sought-after gated development, located along the picturesque Grand Canal in Inchicore, Dublin 8.\r\n\r\nThese elegant two-bedroom apartments have been extensively upgraded throughout, offering the perfect blend of comfort, energy efficiency and style. \r\n\r\nAmple surface-level parking is available within the development for residents and visitors alike.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-time buyer, a professional seeking city convenience or an investor looking for a high-quality turnkey property, Emmet Lodge delivers on every front.\r\n\r\nWith B-rated BERs, these homes qualify for green mortgage rates and offer peace of mind with fixed pricing and immediate availability. \r\n\r\nEvery detail from the sleek modern kitchens to the newly fitted bathrooms has been thoughtfully designed with modern living in mind.\r\n\r\nEffortless Transport Connections\r\n\r\nSituated just 100 metres from the Drimnagh LUAS stop (Red Line), Emmet Lodge offers direct access to key destinations throughout the city:\r\n\r\nLUAS (Red Line):\r\n\r\n• New Children’s Hospital – 6 minutes\r\n• Heuston Station – 10 minutes\r\n• Abbey Street (City Centre) – 18 minutes\r\n• Connolly Station / IFSC – 24 minutes\r\n• The Point / 3Arena – 30 minutes\r\n\r\nBy Dublin Bus:\r\n\r\n (Routes 13, 40, 68, 69 & 70)\r\n\r\n• Dublin City Centre – approx. 30 minutes\r\n• Heuston Station – 20 minutes\r\n• Connolly Station – 35 minutes\r\n\r\nBy Bike:\r\n\r\n(via dedicated cycle lanes)\r\n\r\n• Phoenix Park – 10 minutes\r\n• St Stephen’s Green – 15 minutes\r\n• Grand Canal Dock – 20 minutes\r\n\r\nBy Car:\r\n\r\n• M50 & N7 – 5 minutes\r\n• City Centre – 15 minutes\r\n• Dublin Airport – 25 minutes\r\n\r\nThese are homes designed to offer not just a place to live, but a place to enjoy. From the quality of finish to the energy efficiency, every detail has been taken care of so you can  move straight in and start living.\r\n\r\nSet beside the picturesque Grand Canal, Emmet Lodge enjoys an enviable location just minutes from Dublin’s vibrant City Centre. \r\n\r\nNestled within the characterful and ever-evolving neighbourhood of Inchicore, recently named one of the “Coolest Neighbourhoods on the Planet” by Time Out magazine, this thriving village in Dublin 8 blends the charm of local community living with the energy of the city right on your doorstep. \r\n\r\nThe surrounding areas of Inchicore and nearby Kilmainham are alive with history, creativity, and a strong sense of place, offering residents a rich mix of independent cafés, artisan bakeries, restaurants, pubs and gyms. From food and drink hotspots like Rigger’s D8, Boom Coffee, Union 8, Urban8, to cultural landmarks such as the Irish Museum of Modern Art (IMMA), Kilmainham Gaol, Guinness Storehouse, Vicar Street, and Teeling Distillery, the area is brimming with things to explore. \r\n\r\nOutdoor enthusiasts and wellness seekers will also appreciate the proximity to Phoenix Park, the War Memorial Gardens, the scenic Grand Canal towpath, Weaver Park and a variety of gyms, yoga studios and running routes all contributing to a vibrant, balanced lifestyle in one of Dublin’s most exciting neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nLocated within the gated development of Emmet Court, Emmet Lodge is a newly refurbished apartment block that blends modern style with everyday convenience. \r\n\r\nThe building features upgraded communal areas, including a sleek new passenger lift, an advanced fire alarm system, a purpose-built bin store and a new secure bike storage facilities. \r\n\r\nEvery element has been thoughtfully designed to enhance comfort and ease of living in a stylish, contemporary setting.\r\n\r\nEverything is in place for comfortable, low-maintenance city living, whether you're settling in long term or seeking a smart investment in a rapidly popular area.\r\n\r\nAll apartments are being sold at fixed prices with no bidding and immediate availability. Opportunities like this are rare in Dublin 8 so don’t miss out.\r\n\r\nSpecification Summary\r\nFull internal refurbishment of apartments, including new kitchens, bathrooms, heating systems, flooring, doors, skirtings and architraves.\r\nAppliances include oven and hob. \r\nThere is ample surface parking within the development.\r\nThe development has undergone extensive refurbishment works, which include:\r\nInstallation of new double-glazed uPVC windows with a U-value of 1.4 for improved energy efficiency.\r\nNew passenger lift installed to enhance accessibility.\r\nMechanical Extract Ventilation system fitted for improved air quality and compliance.\r\nUpgraded insulation throughout to improve thermal performance.\r\nComprehensive fire safety upgrade, including a new fire alarm system. \r\nNew pump house and water storage facility installed.\r\nStrong yields on offer as properties can be let at fully market value.\r\n\r\nContact DNG today to arrange your private viewing and experience the lifestyle waiting for you at Emmet Lodge."
      },
