        "Content": "• Fixed pricing - first come, first served.\r\n• All apartments fully refurbished to BER B.\r\n• Apartments completely stripped back, with new kitchens,\r\n• bathrooms, heating, flooring, doors, skirtings and architrave.\r\n• New double glazed uPVC windows with a U value of 1.4.\r\n• New passenger lift.\r\n• New Mechanical Extract Ventilation.\r\n• Additional insultation.\r\n• Fire upgrade works including new fire alarm system. Works commissioned by and signed off by ORS.\r\n• New pump house / water storage facility.\r\n• Ample surface parking\r\n• Secure gated access\r\n• Excellent public transport links - Luas stop 100m from development.\r\n• Local shops and amenities within walking distance.\r\n• Strong yeilds on offer as properties can be let at fully market value."
